# ─── Instagram / Meta Graph API (optional) ───────────────────────────────────
#
# Without these vars the Instagram scraper falls back to HTML scraping and, when
# that is blocked by Instagram's login wall, shows curated "follow for deals"
# profile cards pointing to each restaurant's Instagram page.
#
# To get a token:
#   1. Go to https://developers.facebook.com and create a new App (type: "Other")
#   2. Add the "Instagram Basic Display" or "Instagram Graph API" product
#   3. Under Instagram Graph API → Generate Token, connect your Instagram
#      Business / Creator account and request these permissions:
#        - instagram_basic
#        - pages_show_list (if using Business accounts)
#   4. Exchange the short-lived token for a long-lived one (60-day expiry):
#        curl -i -X GET "https://graph.instagram.com/access_token
#             ?grant_type=ig_exchange_token
#             &client_id=<APP_ID>
#             &client_secret=<APP_SECRET>
#             &access_token=<SHORT_LIVED_TOKEN>"
#   5. Paste the resulting token below.

INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=
